We are considering purchase of the PolyCentre NSR software. A single
server license and several client licenses. Currently we use in house
scripts based on rdump to EXAbyte stackers. I am interested to hear of
success/failure stories for this product and it's compatibility with the
EXAbyte drives, EXB-10e, EXB0CTH10, KTS-8, TTS Series 8000. 

