OSF Guru's,

 Our main printer is used both by VMS and OSF/1
 users.  For VMS users ther burst page is printed
 first, but for the UNIX users it's printed last.
 This causes confusion when trying to sort the 
 print jobs.  The man page says to include the hl
 flag in the printcap entry but this hasn't worked.
 Here's the printcap entry:

   
 ncflp1|lp|bgl_b26:\
        :hl=true:\
        :lf=/usr/adm/lp1err:\
        :lp=:\
        :rm=ncflp1.gsfc.nasa.gov:\
        :rp=text:\
        :sd=/usr/spool/lp1:


 Note the hl=true addition, but it still not
 working.  

 I will summerize.  Many thanks in advance.

Regards
Steve McLaughlin
mclaughl@nssdc.gsfc.nasa.gov

