summary with the original problem statement. My apologies, I meant to do 
this originally but forgot.

Problem Statement:

Accessing a V3.0 or V3.2 system from a PC using KERMIT Telnet, line 25 
of the PC display (status line) is overwritten by output from 'more'. 
